    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/c90ddb89c6b60b203a9b355084f12c09.avif?t=1681909475\" /></div><br>Can you survive this gorgeous but harsh survival resource management game? Play as Paper and find the ultimate inspiration, Life!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/1ae185cc3110c28eb8f42121df2bdec5.avif?t=1681909475\" /></div><br>Paper is an uninspired writer who has lost his muse. Can you help Paper rediscover it while surviving this deadly world? Just living is the real challenge in this beautiful but deadly game.<br><br>Every second life drains from you, so be sure to collect the resources you\u2019ll need to live.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/120c0c40965d065e90f498b30ab6ca08.poster.avif?t=1681909475\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/120c0c40965d065e90f498b30ab6ca08.webm?t=1681909475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/120c0c40965d065e90f498b30ab6ca08.mp4?t=1681909475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Learn to craft and build as you survive the beautiful but lethal world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/25cab882a59a9274bfb2ac597623f3a2.poster.avif?t=1681909475\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/25cab882a59a9274bfb2ac597623f3a2.webm?t=1681909475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/25cab882a59a9274bfb2ac597623f3a2.mp4?t=1681909475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/8fafe738362beea30a9f116495ba1cdc.avif?t=1681909475\" /></div><br>Spend your time exploring wisely, or you may find yourself dying of thirst.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/a10e7277683fe2a9412e964091d33c2b.poster.avif?t=1681909475\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/a10e7277683fe2a9412e964091d33c2b.webm?t=1681909475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/a10e7277683fe2a9412e964091d33c2b.mp4?t=1681909475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You must fight to stay alive here, and not just hunger.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/57978cbd6d04b87036f2b43b90c6e60f.poster.avif?t=1681909475\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/57978cbd6d04b87036f2b43b90c6e60f.webm?t=1681909475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/57978cbd6d04b87036f2b43b90c6e60f.mp4?t=1681909475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/42a44279d94d99b10874c50b81d2f7b6.avif?t=1681909475\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Brilliant HD visual presentation and sound<br></li><li>Abstract and bizarre beings to meet<br></li><li>Engage in interesting activities to survive<br></li><li>Dozens of items to learn and construct<br></li><li>Procedurally generated terrain, explore it forever<br></li><li>Unique hub worlds to visit<br></li><li>Existential main story</li></ul><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/c4921fc9387b93c3d2bf5d6c6e549aef.avif?t=1681909475\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/c90ddb89c6b60b203a9b355084f12c09.avif?t=1681909475\" /></div><br>Can you survive this gorgeous but harsh survival resource management game? Play as Paper and find the ultimate inspiration, Life!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/1ae185cc3110c28eb8f42121df2bdec5.avif?t=1681909475\" /></div><br>Paper is an uninspired writer who has lost his muse. Can you help Paper rediscover it while surviving this deadly world? Just living is the real challenge in this beautiful but deadly game.<br><br>Every second life drains from you, so be sure to collect the resources you\u2019ll need to live.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/120c0c40965d065e90f498b30ab6ca08.poster.avif?t=1681909475\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/120c0c40965d065e90f498b30ab6ca08.webm?t=1681909475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/120c0c40965d065e90f498b30ab6ca08.mp4?t=1681909475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Learn to craft and build as you survive the beautiful but lethal world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/25cab882a59a9274bfb2ac597623f3a2.poster.avif?t=1681909475\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183110/extras/25cab882a59a9274bfb2ac597623f3a2.webm?t=1681909475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai